  "details": "As a VRC sleeper who relies heavily on vrc cuddles to fight insomnia on daily basis, I need long lasting invites from my cuddle buddies, so that I can come back if I crash half way during the sleep.\n\n->Motivation: I find VRC cuddling is very effective in fighting my insomnia.\n\n->Frustration: I very often crash or disconnect half way of my sleep. I cannot go back to my cuddle buddies because they fall asleep and cannot see my invite request. I feel upset not being able to go back to them. And I struggle to sleep without them.\n\n->Resolution suggestion: I need a way to join my cuddle buddies when they are orange and asleep, unable to see invite requests. They can give me a long lasting invite at the beginning. This invite lasts long time throughout my sleep.  I can still see it when I come back from disconnection. And even if I crash for multiple times, the invite can still be here.",
